  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; de integrerarde omr&#xe5;desprogram R&#xe4;dd- ningsverket genomf&#xf6;r i Tuzlaregionen sedan 1995. Projektet st&#xf6;djer inoritetts&#xe5;tervandring till Doboj, Bratunac och Srebrenica, f&#xf6;r sammanlagt 240 familjer/hus, samt lokal infrastruktur. Projektkostnad MSEK 18,717, genomf&#xf6;randetid: 11 m&#xe5;nader med start sep 2000</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a continuation of integrated area programs SRSA have implemented since 1995 in the Tuzla region. it support return of minorities, alaltogether 240 families, to Doboj, Bratunac and Srebrenica. Project amamount is MSEK 18,717, implementation period: 11 months with start Sep2000</narrative>
